---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Contact | AICheck365"
  description="Contact AICheck365 for support, feedback, or questions about our AI image and video detection tool."
  canonical="https://aicheck365.com/contact/"
>
  <main class="page content-page">
    <article class="card content-article">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>

      <p class="lead-text">Have a question, found a bug, or want to suggest a new AI platform for detection? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p>Send us an email at: <a href="mailto:contact@aicheck365.com">contact@aicheck365.com</a></p>

      <h2>GitHub</h2>
      <p>AICheck365 is built on open-source technology. To report bugs or contribute:</p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li><a href="https://github.com/MatrixA/aicheck/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Report a bug on GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/MatrixA/aicheck/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join the discussion</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What to Include</h2>
      <p>If you're reporting a detection issue, please include:</p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li>The AI platform that generated the image or video (e.g., Midjourney, DALL-E, Sora, Kling)</li>
        <li>Whether you're using the original file or a copy</li>
        <li>The detection result you received</li>
        <li>Your browser and operating system</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Please do not send actual image or video files via email</strong> — describe the issue instead.</p>

      <h2>Response Time</h2>
      <p>We aim to respond within 3–5 business days. For urgent security issues, please include "SECURITY" in your subject line.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
